# Phone Vault kernel fragment, slice D: USB gadget functions. The vault only ever exposes
# adb (FunctionFS; removed at the user build, rung 5) and Android Open Accessory (the companion
# transport). Everything else a phone can present over USB goes: mass storage, MTP/PTP, MIDI, HID,
# CCID, audio source, char-dev, Qualcomm diag/QDSS, GSI (RNDIS/ECM network). Host/OTG mode goes
# too: the vault is only ever a USB peripheral (DWC3 gadget-only). Mirrors the USB block of the
# release defconfig (patches/kernel-crosshatch/0001).
# CONFIG_USB_DWC3_DUAL_ROLE is not set
# CONFIG_USB_DWC3_HOST is not set
CONFIG_USB_DWC3_GADGET=y
# CONFIG_USB_DWC3_OF_SIMPLE is not set
# CONFIG_USB_DWC3_PCI is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_MASS_STORAGE is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_AUDIO_SRC is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_CCID is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_CDEV is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_DIAG is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_GSI is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_HID is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_MIDI is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_MTP is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_PTP is not set
# CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_QDSS is not set
# CONFIG_SND_USB_AUDIO_QMI is not set
